  "tip": "<p>When you see a requirement that says <i>no public internet exposure</i> for Cloud SQL, look for <i>private IP only</i> and VPC connectivity. Options that mention IAP or authorized networks still rely on a public endpoint and usually do not satisfy this constraint.</p>",
